      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Gioco apparente:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... c4 [a] 2. Ce7 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... e3 [b] 2. Cxe3 [B] #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Tentativo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. Rh6? [2. Dd8 #]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... e3 [b]  2. Cxe3 [B] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... Ae6 !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Tentativo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. Dh6? [2. Ce7 [A] #]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... Ae6 [g]  2. Dxe6 [D] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... e3 [b] !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Tentativo: 1. Ab2? [2. Ce3 [B] #]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... c4 [a] !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Soluzione:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. Dg4! [2. Dd1 [C] #]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... c4 [a]  2. Ce7 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... e3 [b]  2. Cxe3 [B] # </span></p><p></p>",
