      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">White Ka5 Sb5 Ba2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Black Ke6 Rd5 Be5 Pd4 Bh3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Stipulation H#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations SetPlay</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Twin Move h3 d7</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute command: wine pywin32.exe tmp </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.55 (904 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Ke6-e7 Ka5-b6   2.Rd5-d7 Sb5-a7   3.Ke7-d6 Sa7-c8 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">b) bBh3--&gt;d7</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Bd7-c6 Ba2-b1   2.Rd5-d6 Ka5-b4   3.Ke6-d5 Sb5-c7 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">solution finished. Time = 3.070 s</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
