      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">G.V.:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    1. Da3? (2. Tf8#)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        1. ... d6 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">            2. Df3 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        1. ... Ad6 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">            2. Db3 [B] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    Sventa: 1. ... c5!</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">G.R.:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    1. Dc5! (2. Tf8#)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        1. ... d6 [a] </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">            2. Df2 [C] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        1. ... Ad6 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">            2. Dc4 [D] #</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
