      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd5-f6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd4-d5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Rc7-c5  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Se4-d2 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd4-e4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Be2-f3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sd2*f3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Rc7-c4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sd2*c4 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Se4-f2 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd4-e4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Be2-f3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sf2*d3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Rc7-c4  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Se4-f6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd4-