      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">White Pf5 Sd4 Bf4 Kg4 Rd3 Pc2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Black Pf6 Ra5 Pd5 Ke4 Pe3 Pf3 Bg1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Stipulation #2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations SetPlay</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute command: wine pywin32.exe tmp </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.55 (904 MB)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd4-b3 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...e3-e2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sb3-d2 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-a4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sb3-c5 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd4-e2 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-c3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Bg1-h2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3*e3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-c3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Bg1-f2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-c3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-a3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-a4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-c3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-c5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se2-g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...d5-d4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3*d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...f3*e2  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd4*f3 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...e3-e2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sf3-d2 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-a4  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd4-e6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd3-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Ra5-a4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Se6-c5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...e3-e2  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Sd4-b5 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sb5-c3 # </span>