      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Gioco apparente:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?c8/e8/b7/f7/b5/c4/e4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?(x)e4#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?f5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  2. ?g8 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... f5 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?e5 [B]#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> Tentativo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ?e5? [2. ?xd6#]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?c8/e8/b7/f7/b5/c4/e4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?(x)e4#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?f5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  2. ?g8 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... fxe5 [c]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?xe5 [B]#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... f5!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Tentativo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ?xf6? [2. ?e5 [B] #]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?f7/c4/e4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?(x)e4#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... ?h5!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Tentativo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ?e4? [2. ?d4#]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?f5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  2. ?g8 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?xe4 2. ?xe4#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Ma 1. ... ?b5!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  Soluzione:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ?b4! [2. ?xd6#]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?c8/e8/b7/f7/b5/c4/e4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?(x)e4#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... ?f5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  2. ?g8 [A] #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 1. ... f5 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> 2. ?e5 [B] # </span></p><p></p>",
