      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">White Bh7 Pe4 Pd4 Rd7 Rf6 Kh3 Sa3 Pb2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Black Rh8 Bc8 Qe5 Pe3 Pf3 Kd3 Sf1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Stipulation HS#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations SetPlay WhiteToPlay</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Twin Add white S f6</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute command: wine pywin32.exe tmp </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.55 (901 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1...Qe5*e4   2.Rf6-g6 Qe4*d4   3.Rg6-g2 + Rh8*h7 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">b) wSf6 </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1...Qe5*d4   2.Sf6-d5 Qd4*e4   3.Sd5-c3 + Bc8*d7 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">solution finished. Time = 1.000 s</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
