      "htmlSolution": "<p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1...Ra5-b5   2.Rg8-g6 (Se7-g6?) Rb5-b3   3.Bd5-e6 Rb3-f3 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1...Bb1-c2   2.Se7-g6 (Rg8-g6?) Bc2-a4   3.Re4-f4 Ba4-d7 # </span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
