      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">White Sf8 Ra7 Bd7 Pf6 Pd5 Kf5 Pc4 Sa3 Pf3 Qf2 Pg2 Ba1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Black Kd6 Pc5 Qa4 Pb4 Pe4 Ph4 Bh2 Bd1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Neutral </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Stipulation #2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute command: wine pywin32.exe tmp </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.55 (744 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Bd7*a4 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Ra7-d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sa3-b5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b4*a3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Ra7-d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Bd1*a4  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Bd7-b5 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Ra7-d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Qa4*b5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sa3*b5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...Qa4*a7  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Bd7-c6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ra7-d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*a7 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Sa3-b5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*c6  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.f3-f4 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ba1-e5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2*f4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qf2*f4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*d7 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ra7*d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bd1-g4 +  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Sa3-b5 + ? </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*b5  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.g2-g3 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ba1-e5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*d7 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ra7*d7 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2*g3  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Qf2*h4 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qh4*h2 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2-g1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qh4-g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qh4-f4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ba1-e5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2-e5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ba1*e5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2-f4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qh4*f4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2-g3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qh4*g3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qa4*d7 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ra7*d7 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Qf2-g3 + ? </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...h4*g3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Ba1-e5 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2*g3  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Qf2*c5 + ? </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Kd6*c5  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Ba1-e5 + ? </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Bh2*e5  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">solution finished. Time = 0.010 s</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
