      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Fairy:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a4, e4 Pao </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">c6, f2 Vao</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.VAf2*c5 PAe4-h4   2.Cc2-e3 g3-g4 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.PAa4*e4 VAc5-a7   2.Cb2-c4 b5-b6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Da notare che il cavallo, pur potendo catturare</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">il pedone che muove per dare matto,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">anche se lo facesse non parerebbe il</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">matto così come i pezzi cinesi sulla linea di matto...</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Zilaji</span></p><p></p>",
