      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.d5-d4 Bb3-f7   2.Qb6-a5 Ra2-h2 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">b) bPg7--&gt;h6</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Bb5-c6 Ra2-g2   2.Rb4-b5 Bb3-c2 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Raddoppio del Tema richiestoLe coppie sono rispettivamente:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">* l'Alfiere e la Donna che in a) si nasconde e in b) viene interferita</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">* il Pedone e la Torre che in a) viene interferita e in b) si nasconde</span></p><p></p>",
