      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">GNU: b5, f6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">PAO: b1, g7, h6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a) Diagram</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">   1.GNf6*e4 + Bd6-b4   2.GNe4-d7 (GNe4-d6?) Bb4-d2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">b) wKc6--&gt;b7</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">   1.GNb5*e4 + Rb2-d2   2.GNe4-c3 (GNe4-b3?) Rd2-d3 # </span></p><p></p><p></p>",
