      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">ROCK-LION: a7</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">BISHOP-LION: b8, c7, g1</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">   1.Ke4-d4 + Ka8*b8   2.Rf5-c5 Bh7-e4   3.Sf4-g2 Be4*g2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">b) -bPd3</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">   1.Ke4-d3 + Ka8*a7   2.Sf4-e2 Rh4-e4   3.Rf5-f3 Re4-f4 #</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
