      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">a) Diagram</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Af4*g3 Ag1-h2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">     2.Ag3*f2! Th3*a3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        3.Te5-e3 Ah2-d6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> b) bPb5--&gt;a4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Te2*f2 Th3-h2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">     2.Tf2-f3! Ag1-d4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">        3.Cc2-e3 Th2-b2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"> Le mosse tematiche (2.Axf2 e 2.Tf3) sono le uniche possibili al nero ma generano un controllo della linea di matto.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Controllo che viene eliminato grazie all'interferenza che, sempre il nero, genera con l'ultima mossa.</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
