      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Rg6*b6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.f3-f4 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-e4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.Be8-g6 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Ke4*e3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-e1 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Ra1*e1 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b2-b1=B </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rb6-b5 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-f6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.Rd7-f7 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Kf6-g6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-d3 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Bb1*d3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b2-b1=S  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Rg6-d6 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.f3-f4 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-e4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.Be8-g6 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Ke4*e3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-e1 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Ra1*e1 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b2-b1=S </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sd4-c6 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-f5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.e3-e4 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Kf5-g5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-d2 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Sb1*d2 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b2-b1=B </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Rd6-d5 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-f6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.Rd7-f7 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Kf6-g6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-d3 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Bb1*d3 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Rg6*h6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.f3-f4 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-e4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.Be8-g6 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Ke4*e3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-e1 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Ra1*e1 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">      1...b2-b1=S </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">          2.Sd4-c6 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">              2...Ke5-f5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                  3.e3-e4 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                      3...Kf5-g5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                          4.Qd1-d2 + </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">                              4...Sb1*d2 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 