      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Soluzioni:</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.Zg1*e4 GIc1*g2 +   2.Ze4-g1 (2.Ze4-c1 ?) GIg2*f6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.GIg2*c1 Ze4*g1 +   2.GIc1-g2 (2.GIc1-d5 ?) Zg1*d3 # </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Pezzi fairy:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">c1, g2: GIRAFFA (1+4)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">e4, g1: ZEBRA (2+3)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Zilaji</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Antiduale (per antiblocco)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Switchback</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Semibatterie</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Inchiodature</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Echo diagonale/ortogonale</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Inversione di ruoli</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
