      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Leo a3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Pao a8</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">condition: Sentinelles Chess</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1.Rc6-d6[+bPc6] LEa3-b2[+wPa3]</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\"> (LE-a5?) </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">2.Rd6-e6[+bPd6] PAa8-d8 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">b) wPd3--&gt;e5</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1.Rc6-c4[+bPc6] PAa8-e8</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\"> (PA-a5?) </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">2.Rc4-d4[+bPc4] LEa3-a2[+wPa3] # </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">Duale evitato per effetto sentinella</span></p><p></p>",
