      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Rh4-d4 Sb3*d4 [+wRb3]   2.Rb3-b1 + Qf8-f1 # </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">b)  -wPe3</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Bc7-a5 Sb3*a5 [+wBb3]   2.Bb3*d5 [+bPb3] + Qf8-f3 # </span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">2nd Prize G.Brunori &amp; M.Guida: another excellent strategy with nice exchange of </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">function between the thematic white pieces and very spectacular and specific PWC </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">mates.</span></p><p></p>",
