      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Bb4-d6 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Sc4-e3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qf7*d5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Sa5-b3 # [A]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Ba8*d5 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Sa5-b3 # [A]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...c3-c2  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Sc4-e3 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Bb4-d6 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...c3-c2 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qg1-a1 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Kd4-e5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Bb4*c3 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Qf7*d5 [a]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Qg1-g7 # [B]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">      1...Ba8*d5 [b]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">          2.Sa5-c6 # [C]</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
