      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">White Kg1 Ph6 Ph5 Pf3 Pd2 Pc3 Pb5 Ra8 Pf6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Black Kb1 cgb2 cgc1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Stipulation H#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Twin Move g1 e6</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute command: wine pywin64.exe tmp</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Popeye Windows-64Bit v4.55 (6265 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.CGc1*h6 f6-f7   2.CGh6-h1 f7-f8=Q   3.CGh1-c1 Qf8-f5 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">b) wKg1--&gt;e6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">  1.CGb2*f6 h6-h7   2.CGf6-b6 h7-h8=Q   3.CGb6-b2 Qh8-h7 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">solution finished. Time = 2.960 s</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
