      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Condition Take&amp;MakeChess CirceTake&amp;Make</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">White Rb6 Sh8 Ka1 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Black Kf3 Bg6 Pe6 Pb3 Pf6 Pa7 Ph5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Stipulation H#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations SetPlay WhiteToPlay</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Execute command: pywin32.exe tmp</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.63 (976 MB)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1...Sh8*g6-e4[+bBe8]   2.Kf3*e4-c5[+wSd6] Sd6*e8-b5[+bBc6]   3.Kc5*b6-b8[+wRa6] Ra6*c6-a8[+bBb7] #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1...Sh8*g6-e8[+bBf7]   2.Bf7*e8-d6[+wSc7] Rb6*d6-f4[+bBc5] +   3.Kf3*f4-a4[+wRf5] Rf5*c5-a3[+bBb4] #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">solution finished. Time = 26.821 s</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
