      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">White Ke7 Pc4 trc3 nda6 trf8 Pe3 Ph4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Black Kf5 Pg5 trf4 ndf7 Pg6 Pg4 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Stipulation H#2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Twin Rotate 180</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Executing command: pywin32.exe tmp</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Popeye Windows-32Bit v4.63 (5695 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.TRf4*c4-b4 NDa6-d3   2.g5*h4 TRc3-c5 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">b) rotate 180</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.NDc2*f5-g6 TRf6-f4   2.b3-b2 NDh3-e6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Se