      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Ra7-a3 b2*a3   2.Rb4-c4 Sd2-b3 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">b) wPb2--&gt;b3</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Ra7-a4 b3*a4   2.Bb5*c6 Sb8-a6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">c) wPb2--&gt;g5</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Sc8-d6 g5-g6   2.Sd6-c4 Sd2-e4 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">d) wPb2--&gt;f6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Sc8-e7 f6-f7   2.Se7*c6 Sb8-d7 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">FEN:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">1Nn5/r1p4q/1pP1K3/1bk5/1r6/4P3/1P1N4/8</span></p><p></p>",
