      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1.g4-g5 ? threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">          2.Rh4-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">      1...Ra7-d7 (a)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">          2.Bh7*f5 # [A]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">    but</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">      1...e7-e5  !</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">  1.g4*f5 ! threat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">          2.Rh4-d4 # </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">      1...Ra7-d7 (a)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">          2.f5-f6 # [B]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">      1...e7-e5 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">          2.f5*e6 ep. #</span><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\"> </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">Cambio di matto</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">Presa en passant.</span></p><p></p>",
