      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Sc4*d2 Ba3-b4   2.Sd2-c4 (Se5?) Bb4-e1   3.Qf3-f6 Ra2-g2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">b) bSc4--&gt;b7</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Sb7*c5 Ra2-c2   2.Sc5-b7 (Sd7?) Rc2-c6   3.Qf3-g4 Ba3-e7 #</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
