      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">White Ka8 Bd7 Sf7 Pc4 Pb5 Pg4 Pf4 Se7 Be5 Pd4 Pb4 Ph4 Pg3 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Black Be8 Rg8 Ke4 Pg7 Pe3 Pb6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Stipulation H#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Option NoBoard Variations SetPlay Try WhiteToPlay</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Executing command: pywin64_2.exe tmp</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Popeye Windows-64Bit v4.55 (5581 MB)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1...Sf7-d8   2.Be8-h5 g4-g5   3.Bh5-f3 Bd7-f5 #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1...Bd7-c8   2.Be8*b5 c4-c5   3.Bb5-d3 Sf7-g5 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">solution finished. Time = 0.172 s</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
