      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1.Qb5*e2 Bb3-d1   2.Qe2-g4 Ra2-h2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">b) bPg5--&gt;g4</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1.Qb5*d5 Ra2-a5   2.Qd5-g5 Bb3-f7 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Opened lines:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">A) a2-h2 (to give a pin), d1-g4 (to go to the checkmate square)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">B) b3-f7 (to give a pin), a5-g5 (to go to the checkmate square)</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
