      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Rg6</span><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">-g7 (Interferenza preventiva) Re2-d2   2.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Bf1</span><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">-b5 (Autoblocco) Bf6-d4 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">b) bPd6--&gt;b5  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Bf1</span><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">-g2 (Interferenza preventiva) Bf6-e5   2.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Rg6</span><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">-b6 (Autoblocco) Re2-c2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Movimenti lungo le linee di inchiodatura</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Matti lungo le linee di inchiodatura</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Interferenze</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Interferenze preventive</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">Interessante notare come la collaborazione tra nero e bianco è obbligata dalle necessarie aperture di linea del bianco</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">B1 interferenza preventiva (e NON schiodatura!)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">W1 controllo diretto</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">B2 autoblocco</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">W2 matto</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
