      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">BeginProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Pieces</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">White Kh5 Ba7 Bd7 Sg3 Pb3 Pc5 Pd3 Ph4 Ph6 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Black Kd5 Rc1 Bd1 Pb4 Pc6 Pc7 Pc2 Pd2 Pe2 Pf6 Ph7 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Stipulation H#3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Option Try NoBoard Variations</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Twin Move d3 f4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">EndProblem</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Execute command: pywin64.exe tmp</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Popeye Windows-64Bit v4.69 (5101 MB)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.e2-e1=B + (S+?) Sg3-e2   2.Be1-g3 Bd7-e8   3.Bg3-e5 Be8-f7 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">b) wPd3--&gt;f4  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.e2-e1=S + (B+?) Bd7-g4   2.Se1-f3 Sg3-e4   3.Sf3-d4 Se4*f6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">solution finished. Time = 1.141 s</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
