      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">v1: 8/r3b2K/p1N3r1/2N3PR/2k5/q6R/8/1b6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">a)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Rg6*g5 [a]+ Sc5-e4 (A) [Sd3? (B)]  2.Rg5-g6 Se4-d2 (Sd6? [X])#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Be7*g5 [b]+ Sc5-d7 (C) [Sb7? (D)]  2.Bg5-e7 Sd7-b6 (Se5? [Y])#</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">b) bQa3--&gt;a5  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Rg6*g5 [a]+ Sc5-d3 (B) [Se4? (A)]  2.Rg5-g6 Sd3-b2 (Se5? [Y]) #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Be7*g5 [b]+ Sc5-b7 (D) [Sd7? (D)]  2.Bg5-e7 Sb7*a5 (Sd6? [X])#</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">v2: 8/r3b2K/p3p1r1/2N3PR/1pkp4/1n5R/8/1b6</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Rg6*g5 [a]+ Sc5-d3 [A] (Se4? [B])  2.Rg5-g6 Sd3-b2 (Se5? [X]) #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Be7*g5 [b]+ Sc5-d7 [C] (Sb7? [D])  2.Bg5-e7 Sd7-b6 (Se5? [X]) #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: DengXian; font-size: 11pt;\">b) bSb3--&gt;a4  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Rg6*g5 [a]+ Sc5-e4 [B] (Sd3? [A])  2.Rg5-g6 Se4-d2 (Sd6? [Y]) #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 12pt;\">  1.Be7*g5 [b]+ Sc5-b7 [D] (Sd7? [C])  2.Bg5-e7 Sb7-a5 (Sd6? [Y]) #</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
