      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Bb1-a2 </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">Re4-f4 (R~?)   </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">2.Ba2-b3 d4*e5 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Ra7-a4 </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">Bf7-e6 (B~?)  </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">2.Ra4-b4 d5-d6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">Mossa tematica B1 che consente W1! tempo</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">Notare che W1 ha una sola casa possibile altrimenti il pezzo finirebbe in una casa controllata dal nero.</span></p><p></p><p></p>",
