      "htmlSolution": "<p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1.Bf2-h4 (Be3? A)  Sc5-e4  (Se6 Bg5 Sf4? B) 2.Bh4-g5 Se4-g3 (Sf6? C) #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">  1.Rd7-d5 (Rg7? A) Sc7-e8  (Se6 Rg5 Sf4? B) 2.Rd5-g5 Se8-f6 (Sg7? C) #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">3 tipologie di antiduale:</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">A. Inchiodatura</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">B. Interferenza</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">C. Guardia</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft NeoGothic&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\">Miniatura</span></p><p></p>",
