      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">a) </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Kd1-e1 Sa2-b4   2.d2-d1=R (d2-d1=B?; d2-d1=S?) Sb4-c2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">b) bKd1--&gt;e1  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">  1.Ke1-d1 Bh3-e6   2.e2-e1=B (e2-e1=S?; e2-e1=R?) Be6-b3 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">Ciclo di effetti degli antiduali nelle promozioni:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">X = Guardia</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">Y = Scacco</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">      =B      =S      =R</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">a)     X         Y</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">b)                X       Y</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
