      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Rh2-h4</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Bc2-b3</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">   2.Bg8-e6 Rd5*e5   3.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Be6-g4</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"> Bb3-f7 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Bg8-h7</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Rd5-d2</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">   2.Rh2-g2 Bc2-f5   3.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">Rg2*g5</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"> Rd2-h2 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">Matti modello</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">B1 e B3 - Schiodature dirette</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">W1 - Schiodatura indiretta</span></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\