      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">a) Diagram</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Kg2-f3 Bd8-e7   2.Kf3-e2 Rf8-g8   3.Ke2-e1 Rg8-g1   4.Qd3-d2 + Be7-b4 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">b)  +bPa4</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Kg2-h3 Re8-e7   2.Kh3*h4 h6-h5   3.Kh4-g5 Rf8-h8   4.Qd3*f5 + Re7-e5 #</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
