      "htmlSolution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">Condizione: AntiKings</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">1.Kg5*h6 Bc1-f4 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">(1... Ba3+? 2.K*h5 Bc5+?? anti-scacco!)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">    2.Kh6*h5 Bf4-e5 #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">(1.K*h5? Bf4 2.K*h6 Be5+? 3.Kg7!!)</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">1.Kg5*h5 Ra5-f5 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">(1... Re5? 2.K*h6 Re3+?? anti-scacco!)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">    2.Kh5*h6 Rf5-f4 #</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">(1.K*h6? Rf5 2.K*h5 Rf4+? 3.Kg4!!)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">(nota: il pedone h4 serve esclusivamente a precisare il secondo tentativo K*h6 ma per la precisione del gioco ci può stare dato che si tratta di un pedone nero)</span></p><p></p>",
