      "htmlSolution": "<p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">a) Diagram</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1...f6-f7   2.Ke3-f4 f7-f8=Q +   3.Kf4-e5 Qf8-f6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">b) a1=h1</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1...f6-f7   2.Kf5-f6 Kc7-d6   3.Bh4-g5 f7-f8=Q #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">c) a1=h8  + H#3</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Rc7-c8 f6-f7   2.Kd6-c7 f7-f8=S   3.Kc7-d8 Sf8-e6 #</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 9pt;\">d) a1=a8 + H#3</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">  1.Ba5-d8 c6-c7   2.e5-e4 c7*d8=Q   3.e4*f3 Qd8-d4 #</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
