      "htmlSolution": "<p>   1.Bd7-a4 ? threat:</p><p>          2.Sg6*f4 #</p><p>      1...Sg3-h5</p><p>          2.Kg8-f7 threat:</p><p>                  3.Sg6-e7 #</p><p>      1...Kd5*e6 [a]</p><p>          2.Ba4-b3 + [A]</p><p>              2...Ke6-f5</p><p>                  3.Sg6-h4 #</p><p>    but</p><p>      1...Sg3-e2 !</p><p></p><p>   1.Bd7-b5 ? threat:</p><p>          2.Sg6*f4 #</p><p>      1...Sg3-h5</p><p>          2.Kg8-f7 threat:</p><p>                  3.Sg6-e7 #</p><p>      1...Kd5*e6 [a]</p><p>          2.Bb5-c4 + [B]</p><p>              2...Ke6-f5</p><p>                  3.Sg6-h4 #</p><p>    but</p><p>      1...Sg3-e2 !</p><p></p><p>   1.Bd7-e8 ? threat:</p><p>          2.Sg6*f4 #</p><p>      1...Sg3-h5</p><p>          2.Kg8-f7 threat:</p><p>                  3.Sg6-e7 #</p><p>      1...Kd5*e6 [a]</p><p>          2.Be8-f7 + [C]</p><p>              2...Ke6-f5</p><p>                  3.Sg6-h4 #</p><p>    but</p><p>      1...Sg3-e2 !</p><p></p><p>   1.Bd7-c8 ! threat:</p><p>          2.Sg6-e7 #</p><p>      1...Sg3-f5</p><p>          2.Bc8-b7 +</p><p>              2...Kd5*e6</p><p>                  3.d4-d5 #</p><p>      1...Kd5-c6 [b]</p><p>          2.Bc8-b7 + [C]</p><p>              2...Kc6-c7</p><p>                  3.Rd8-c8 #</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
