      "htmlSolution": "<p>a) diagram</p><p></p><p>1... ... 2.Bh5*e2 + Kd1*e2 3.a5-a4 Be1-g3 4.Kb6-a5 Bg3-c7 #</p><p></p><p><strong>1...Sd3-b2 2.Rg1*e1 + Kd1*e1 3.b5-b4 Re2-e7 </strong>(Re2-e8?)<strong> 4.Kb6-b5 Re7-b7 #</strong></p><p></p><p>b) after the key</p><p></p><p>1... ... 2.Rg1*e1 + Kd1*e1 3.b5-b4 Re2-e7 4.Kb6-b5 Re7-b7 #</p><p></p><p><strong>1...Sb2-d3 2.Bh5*e2 + Kd1*e2 3.a5-a4 Be1-g3 </strong>(Be1-h4?)<strong> 4.Kb6-a5 Bg3-c7 #</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p>ZILAHI</p><p>PERPETUUM MOBILE</p><p>DUAL AVOIDANCE</p><p></p><p></p>",
