      "htmlSolution": "<p>   1.<strong>Sc6-a7 </strong>? [threat: 2.Qb7-b4 + 2...Rd4*b4 3.Se1*d3 + 3...Sf4*d3 #]</p><p>      1...a2-a1=B  (Thematic)</p><p>          2.Bc1-b2 [threat: 3.Qb7-b4 + 3...Rd4*b4 4.Se1*d3 + 4...Sf4*d3 #]</p><p></p><p>    but</p><p>      1...a2-a1=Q !  (Thematic)</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>   1.<strong>Sc6-d8 </strong>! [threat: 2.Sd8-e6 + 2...Sf4*e6 3.Qb7*d5 + 3...Rd4*d5 #]</p><p>      1...Bg1-h2 (Thematic)</p><p>          2.Rg5-g3 [threat: 3.Sd8-e6 + 3...Sf4*e6 4.Qb7*d5 + 4...Rd4*d5 #]</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
