      "htmlSolution": "<p>  1.GN<strong>h2</strong>-f3 (a) GNe2-c3 (A) (1...GNd1-c3? (C))  2.GN<strong>d8</strong>-c6+ (b) GNa5*c6# (B)</p><p></p><p>  1.GN<strong>d8</strong>-c5 (b) GNd1-e4 (C) (1...GNa5-d6? (B))  2.R<strong>d4</strong>-d5+ (c) GNe2*d5# (A)</p><p></p><p>  1.R<strong>d4</strong>-g4 (c) GNa5-d4 (B) (1...GNe2-d4? (A))  2.GN<strong>h2</strong>-e3+ (a) GNd1*e3# (C)</p><p></p><p>cycle of white roles</p><p>cycle of black roles</p><p>cyclic dual avoidance of pieces (piece A not B, piece B not C, piece C not A, the focus is the control of square b5)</p><p></p><p>meredith</p><p></p><p></p>",
